It's a sight to see.

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,520
The shore is so fast with umbrellas,

6
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,880
you can hardly see the sand.

7
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,000
We're live at the Yulegahapa beach

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:15,800
where it looks like a...

9
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,680
A swimsuit?

10
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,640
Huh? You okay?

11
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:25,700
