12
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:27,860
Hobotone, there you are!

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,120
I've been looking for you everywhere.

14
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:32,560
So?

15
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:35,040
So, what game should we play today?

16
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:35,540
None.

17
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,880
We could hit the pool and shout Marco Polo.

18
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:38,240
No.

19
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,280
How cute!

20
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,380
She's totally rejecting me!

21
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,180
What about you?

22
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,360
Did you bring your swimsuit?

23
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:44,900
I did.

24
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:47,360
Stupid Yozara told me to, just in case.

25
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:48,740
We're here.

26
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,340
You're so hilarious.

27
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,540
Huh.

28
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:54,660
A horse?

29
00:02:25,854 --> 00:02:36,454
I never would have guessed I'd encounter the demon Astaroth in a place like this.

30
00:02:37,294 --> 00:02:41,174
Wait, I thought the evil gate was destroyed during the last war between God and the devil.

31
00:02:41,414 --> 00:02:43,014
Stop it. You're creeping me out.

32
00:02:43,214 --> 00:02:43,614
Yozara?

33
00:02:44,234 --> 00:02:45,194
That's Yozara?

34
00:02:45,634 --> 00:02:45,994
Indeed.

35
00:02:46,434 --> 00:02:48,914
What are you doing dressed up like that, you weirdo?

36
00:02:49,094 --> 00:02:49,754
It's creepy.

37
00:02:50,694 --> 00:02:52,134
Don't. Stay back.

38
00:02:52,254 --> 00:02:54,294
Get away from me, freak. You're gross.

39
00:02:54,294 --> 00:02:57,314
Ah! Damn it! What was that for?

40
00:02:57,514 --> 00:02:59,274
Someone want to tell me what's going on?

41
00:02:59,634 --> 00:03:00,874
Today is swimsuit day.

42
00:03:01,334 --> 00:03:01,994
It is?

43
00:03:02,234 --> 00:03:05,054
Yeah, the plan was to wear swimsuits all day at the club.

44
00:03:05,174 --> 00:03:06,194
Why would we do that?

45
00:03:06,554 --> 00:03:09,654
Because it would be a shame not to wear my swimsuit after all the money I spent.

46
00:03:10,014 --> 00:03:12,654
This is all your fault. You just had to go home.

47
00:03:12,914 --> 00:03:15,674
The pool was too crowded. It was impossible to have any fun.

48
00:03:16,114 --> 00:03:18,834
You could barely get in, much less find a place to sit.

49
00:03:18,894 --> 00:03:19,514
Are you serious?

50
00:03:20,454 --> 00:03:22,194
Uh, yeah, I am.

51
00:03:23,094 --> 00:03:23,574
Ugh.

52
00:03:24,294 --> 00:03:25,374
So what's going on?

53
00:03:25,794 --> 00:03:28,394
Like, why in the hell are you wearing that horse mask?

54
00:03:28,474 --> 00:03:30,674
Not to mention the full-bodied zebra swimsuit.

55
00:03:30,854 --> 00:03:33,334
It's embarrassing to show your skin in front of a bunch of strangers.

56
00:03:33,634 --> 00:03:35,014
And like you said, the pool is packed.

57
00:03:35,934 --> 00:03:38,894
With this outfit, my flesh isn't exposed and no one can see my face.

58
00:03:39,014 --> 00:03:40,014
So I can keep my dignity.

59
00:03:40,674 --> 00:03:44,214
If you went to the pool wearing that ridiculous thing, everyone would hate you.

60
00:03:44,434 --> 00:03:45,594
They can hate me all they want.

61
00:03:45,694 --> 00:03:47,674
There's no rule that says I can't wear a horse mask.

62
00:03:48,274 --> 00:03:51,174
Yeah, maybe not, but I'm pretty sure there's a rule against freak shows.

63
00:03:51,174 --> 00:03:52,554
Then they wouldn't let you in either.

64
00:03:52,714 --> 00:03:53,734
You take that back!

65
00:03:54,074 --> 00:03:56,514
When you walk into a swimming pool, everyone immediately starts crawling.

66
00:03:56,514 --> 00:03:57,274
Hey, Kodaka.

67
00:03:57,554 --> 00:03:57,854
Uh.

68
00:03:58,494 --> 00:04:00,214
Rika's wearing a swimsuit under her coat.

69
00:04:00,474 --> 00:04:01,534
Want to take a look?

70
00:04:01,794 --> 00:04:02,914
Uh, not really.

71
00:04:02,914 --> 00:04:07,294
