76
00:04:12,974 --> 00:04:14,474
Why don't you sneak a peek then?

77
00:04:14,974 --> 00:04:16,334
Knock it off, all right?

78
00:04:16,474 --> 00:04:17,934
Rika's just pulling your chain.

79
00:04:18,934 --> 00:04:19,714
Come on.

80
00:04:20,134 --> 00:04:21,274
Tell Rika how she looks.

81
00:04:21,534 --> 00:04:22,794
