82
00:04:23,074 --> 00:04:23,374
What?

83
00:04:23,734 --> 00:04:24,174
Normal?

84
00:04:24,634 --> 00:04:27,774
It might seem that way on the outside, but this suit's special.

85
00:04:28,014 --> 00:04:30,334
Once it gets in hot water, it's completely see-through.

86
00:04:30,334 --> 00:04:33,374
Rika will take him to a private secluded hot spring.

87
00:04:33,674 --> 00:04:35,634
