89
00:04:39,554 --> 00:04:43,374
Kodaka will lose control and give in to his carnal desires rising up from deep within.

90
00:04:44,374 --> 00:04:45,434
Not gonna happen.

91
00:04:45,694 --> 00:04:48,854
I wouldn't go to a hot spring with you, not if my life depended on it.

92
00:04:49,274 --> 00:04:49,954
