110
00:05:10,054 --> 00:05:11,994
Don't worry, I'll throw you on the grill first.

111
00:05:12,054 --> 00:05:13,434
No, I still won't taste good!

112
00:05:13,494 --> 00:05:14,214
Not even then!

113
00:05:14,414 --> 00:05:16,034
Plus, all I've been eating are vegetables!

114
00:05:16,474 --> 00:05:18,134
Good, because I'm a vegetarian.

115
00:05:18,514 --> 00:05:19,194
Oh, no!

116
00:05:19,694 --> 00:05:21,354
If I would have known this was gonna happen,

117
00:05:21,434 --> 00:05:22,914
I never would have stopped eating steak.

118
00:05:22,994 --> 00:05:24,774
I would have given myself a nice, fat, fluffy-

119
00:05:24,774 --> 00:05:25,734
She doesn't eat steak?

120
00:05:25,954 --> 00:05:26,254
Weird.

121
00:05:26,254 --> 00:05:28,094
Recently, Maria changed her diet.

122
00:05:28,374 --> 00:05:30,534
She decided she was really into normal eating.

123
00:05:31,074 --> 00:05:31,934
Coo-coo-coo!

124
00:05:32,614 --> 00:05:33,614
Do it, horse devil!

125
00:05:33,714 --> 00:05:34,734
Take that girl out!

126
00:05:34,914 --> 00:05:36,414
Start at the head and munch your way down

127
00:05:36,414 --> 00:05:38,314
