128
00:05:38,434 --> 00:05:40,254
Okay, this is just getting ridiculous.

129
00:05:40,734 --> 00:05:41,034
Ah!

130
00:05:41,594 --> 00:05:42,414
I see!

131
00:05:42,594 --> 00:05:44,434
You're a friend of the bloodsucker, aren't you?

132
00:05:44,774 --> 00:05:47,254
You and that stupid moronic poophead of a vampire

133
00:05:47,254 --> 00:05:48,534
can both rot in hell!

134
00:05:48,614 --> 00:05:49,394
Coo-coo-coo!

135
00:05:49,694 --> 00:05:51,014
It's time for you to die!

136
00:05:51,114 --> 00:05:53,054
I like my little girl's medium rares

137
00:05:53,054 --> 00:05:55,434
