138
00:05:55,434 --> 00:05:56,754
You look so good!

139
00:05:56,894 --> 00:05:58,874
Okay, Yozora, I think she's had enough.

140
00:05:59,254 --> 00:06:00,254
Oh, all right.

141
00:06:03,254 --> 00:06:05,114
Oh, no!

142
00:06:05,294 --> 00:06:06,634
