148
00:06:15,954 --> 00:06:17,994
I can't see anything!

149
00:06:18,134 --> 00:06:19,374
It's bit black in here!

150
00:06:19,834 --> 00:06:20,614
Coo-coo-coo!

151
00:06:20,734 --> 00:06:22,694
