153
00:06:25,814 --> 00:06:28,174
But I don't want to be a horse monster forever!

154
00:06:28,454 --> 00:06:29,074
Help me!

155
00:06:29,194 --> 00:06:29,974
Coo-coo-coo!

156
00:06:30,314 --> 00:06:31,354
If you really want help,

157
00:06:31,414 --> 00:06:33,394
