158
00:06:33,654 --> 00:06:34,034
Never!

159
00:06:34,454 --> 00:06:35,634
I love big brother!

160
00:06:35,634 --> 00:06:39,394
Don't you dare say you love him, you stupid head!

161
00:06:41,954 --> 00:06:42,634
It's off!

162
00:06:42,794 --> 00:06:43,834
You just broke the curse!

163
00:06:45,194 --> 00:06:46,794
That's what you get, turd!

164
00:06:46,894 --> 00:06:47,774
Why, you...

165
00:06:47,774 --> 00:06:48,374
You...

166
