172
00:06:57,754 --> 00:07:00,174
We could always go to my family's private beach instead.

173
00:07:00,174 --> 00:07:02,874
Wait, private beach?

174
00:07:03,134 --> 00:07:05,174
Yeah, we've got a place right by the water.

175
00:07:06,094 --> 00:07:07,894
It figures, rich girl.

176
00:07:08,254 --> 00:07:10,014
Well, to be completely honest,

177
00:07:10,094 --> 00:07:11,354
I've only been there one time,

178
00:07:11,454 --> 00:07:12,634
back when I was a little kid.

179
00:07:13,054 --> 00:07:14,494
Besides, it's so far away,

180
00:07:14,534 --> 00:07:15,814
