181
00:07:16,074 --> 00:07:16,714
Hold on!

182
00:07:16,954 --> 00:07:18,574
Does that mean we'd be able to go out there

183
00:07:18,574 --> 00:07:20,554
and hold a training camp sometime over the summer?

184
00:07:21,254 --> 00:07:21,934
Oh, yeah.

185
00:07:22,194 --> 00:07:23,114
I guess we could.

186
00:07:23,774 --> 00:07:25,434
Actually, that sounds really fun.

187
00:07:25,534 --> 00:07:27,214
Like an overnight club field trip.

188
00:07:27,674 --> 00:07:29,874
Plus, this could be a perfect experience

189
00:07:29,874 --> 00:07:30,934
to prepare all of us

190
00:07:30,934 --> 00:07:31,954
for what life will be like

191
00:07:31,954 --> 00:07:33,254
when we become happy people.

192
00:07:33,374 --> 00:07:33,994
Sounds good.

193
00:07:34,294 --> 00:07:35,394
I'll ask my daddy then.

194
00:07:36,134 --> 00:07:37,914
So, it's okay to set it up?

195
00:07:38,234 --> 00:07:39,934
Does anyone have any plans they know about?

196
00:07:40,054 --> 00:07:41,094
I'm guessing we're free.

197
00:07:41,454 --> 00:07:42,394
I mean, let's face it,

198
00:07:42,394 --> 00:07:43,714
