204
00:07:52,134 --> 00:07:52,794
Good point.

205
00:07:53,214 --> 00:07:53,554
Huh?

206
00:07:53,554 --> 00:07:53,614
Huh?

207
00:07:53,614 --> 00:08:04,634
Hey.

208
00:08:05,294 --> 00:08:06,254
Uh, hello?

209
00:08:06,714 --> 00:08:07,414
Hi there.

210
00:08:07,894 --> 00:08:09,574
This is Senna Kajiwazaki.

211
00:08:10,054 --> 00:08:11,054
Is Kodaka available?

212
00:08:11,634 --> 00:08:12,514
Relax, Senna.

213
00:08:12,674 --> 00:08:14,454
Don't you know this is my cell phone number?

214
00:08:14,634 --> 00:08:14,894
Huh?

215
00:08:15,394 --> 00:08:15,774
Oh, yeah.

216
00:08:15,994 --> 00:08:16,834
Right, I knew that.

217
00:08:17,394 --> 00:08:18,694
So, what's going on?

218
00:08:18,974 --> 00:08:20,854
Uh, are you free today by any chance?

219
00:08:21,134 --> 00:08:21,794
Kobito, too.

220
00:08:21,854 --> 00:08:23,994
Yeah, just have to drop by the club after lunch.

221
00:08:24,194 --> 00:08:24,514
Great!

222
00:08:24,674 --> 00:08:25,634
Then come to my house.

223
00:08:25,914 --> 00:08:26,214
Why?

224
00:08:26,454 --> 00:08:28,034
Do you remember what you said before?

225
00:08:28,434 --> 00:08:30,454
About wanting to pay respects to my father.

226
00:08:30,594 --> 00:08:32,414
Yeah, but this is kinda out of nowhere.

227
00:08:32,774 --> 00:08:34,094
Well, the thing is,

228
00:08:34,154 --> 00:08:36,154
when I asked him about us using the summer house,

229
00:08:36,254 --> 00:08:37,074
I mentioned your name.

230
00:08:37,354 --> 00:08:39,554
And now Daddy says he wants to meet you ASAP.

231
00:08:39,954 --> 00:08:40,574
How come?

232
00:08:40,814 --> 00:08:41,314
I don't know.

233
00:08:41,694 --> 00:08:42,654
Would you mind coming over?

234
00:08:43,094 --> 00:08:44,594
Uh, yeah, I'll be there.

235
00:08:44,814 --> 00:08:46,754
Great, I guess all you'll need are directions then.

236
00:08:46,994 --> 00:08:47,274
Cool.

237
00:08:47,554 --> 00:08:48,474
Let me write them down.

238
00:08:48,694 --> 00:08:53,994
The due date's written down on the card.

239
00:09:06,654 --> 00:09:07,914
He won't be there.

240
00:09:07,914 --> 00:09:08,554
The due date's written down on the card.

241
00:09:12,014 --> 00:09:14,014
Ugh.

242
00:09:14,474 --> 00:09:14,974
Oh, yeah.

243
00:09:25,234 --> 00:09:25,834
We'll be there.

244
00:09:25,834 --> 00:09:51,574
Oh, wow.

245
00:09:55,834 --> 00:09:59,174
All right, here we go.

246
00:10:15,174 --> 00:10:16,534
Um, hello.

247
00:10:16,854 --> 00:10:18,114
Good day to you both.

248
00:10:18,334 --> 00:10:19,914
Thank you for coming all this way.

249
00:10:19,914 --> 00:10:21,794
I am president of the academy,

250
00:10:22,214 --> 00:10:23,874
but I moonlight his son his dad, too.

251
00:10:23,874 --> 00:10:26,074
Uh, it's very nice to meet you, sir.

252
00:10:26,374 --> 00:10:27,414
My name is Kodaka.

253
00:10:27,994 --> 00:10:29,594
This is my younger sister, Kobito.

254
00:10:30,114 --> 00:10:32,674
Has anyone told you that you look exactly like your father?

255
00:10:33,314 --> 00:10:36,054
This one's lucky enough to have Iri's lovely face.

256
00:10:37,534 --> 00:10:38,834
Please dine with us.

257
00:10:39,054 --> 00:10:39,314
Come.

258
00:10:40,014 --> 00:10:40,574
This way.

259
00:10:40,834 --> 00:10:41,474
Sir, wait.

260
00:10:41,694 --> 00:10:43,894
It's extremely rude to invite someone into your home

261
00:10:43,894 --> 00:10:45,354
without giving them your name first.

262
00:10:46,574 --> 00:10:47,094
Right.

263
00:10:47,434 --> 00:10:49,574
I'm Mr. Kashiwazaki.

264
00:10:50,114 --> 00:10:50,934
That's my name.

265
00:10:50,934 --> 00:10:53,654
But you can call me Heavenstud.

266
00:10:54,434 --> 00:10:55,454
Wait, Heavenstud?

267
00:10:55,694 --> 00:10:56,954
That's really your name?

268
00:10:57,334 --> 00:10:58,994
No, his name's Pegasus.

269
00:10:59,634 --> 00:11:00,154
Pegasus?

270
00:11:00,434 --> 00:11:02,714
How dare you insult me by calling me that!

271
00:11:05,014 --> 00:11:05,614
Sorry.

272
00:11:06,434 --> 00:11:09,554
It's just, people made fun of me a lot in high school.

273
00:11:10,134 --> 00:11:11,234
