277
00:11:16,574 --> 00:11:17,134
Steward?

278
00:11:17,874 --> 00:11:19,714
Please don't stare at me like that, sir.

279
00:11:19,774 --> 00:11:20,774
It makes me uncomfortable.

280
00:11:21,354 --> 00:11:22,814
