285
00:11:37,574 --> 00:11:39,134
Sorry, this is all so new to me.

286
00:11:39,354 --> 00:11:41,714
My wife's currently vacationing around the world.

287
00:11:41,874 --> 00:11:43,114
I gotta say, I'm surprised.

288
00:11:43,274 --> 00:11:44,954
It's not very often you take the time

289
00:11:44,954 --> 00:11:46,534
