303
00:12:10,734 --> 00:12:11,674
Thanks for the food.

304
00:12:11,674 --> 00:12:12,534
Oh, yeah.

305
00:12:12,874 --> 00:12:13,754
Thanks for the food.

306
00:12:24,534 --> 00:12:28,174
