307
00:12:28,834 --> 00:12:31,334
It seems like my dad asked you for a pretty big favor.

308
00:12:31,534 --> 00:12:32,114
That's true.

309
00:12:32,174 --> 00:12:32,954
It was indeed.

310
00:12:33,474 --> 00:12:35,874
