321
00:12:55,894 --> 00:12:56,294
Hmm?

322
00:12:56,394 --> 00:12:57,294
Well, what is it?

323
00:12:57,414 --> 00:12:59,254
A world-famous spicy sesame oil.

324
00:12:59,494 --> 00:13:01,614
Next time you cook a meal, add in a little bit of this,

325
00:13:01,674 --> 00:13:03,054
and I promise you won't regret it.

326
00:13:03,454 --> 00:13:04,094
Thank you?

327
00:13:04,094 --> 00:13:06,754
Well, trust me, it can make everything taste better.

328
00:13:06,754 --> 00:13:09,514
It goes good with rice, pasta, really anything.

329
00:13:09,854 --> 00:13:12,234
Even Kobito likes it, and she hates spicy food.

330
00:13:12,394 --> 00:13:13,674
Do you mind if I open one?

331
00:13:13,974 --> 00:13:14,774
Please, go ahead.

332
00:13:22,634 --> 00:13:23,394
That's good.

333
00:13:24,314 --> 00:13:25,074
You're right.

334
00:13:25,214 --> 00:13:26,214
This stuff is awesome.

335
00:13:26,614 --> 00:13:27,434
Glad you like it.

336
00:13:27,694 --> 00:13:28,154
Me too.

337
00:13:28,214 --> 00:13:28,974
I want some.

338
00:13:29,294 --> 00:13:31,994
Well, then your big sister will feed you some more.

339
00:13:32,254 --> 00:13:35,154
