350
00:13:56,014 --> 00:13:56,614
The scum.

351
00:13:56,874 --> 00:13:57,994
He's not scum!

352
00:13:57,994 --> 00:14:04,254
I'm sorry.

353
00:14:05,094 --> 00:14:08,174
