407
00:16:06,374 --> 00:16:08,034
No, it's like I said, I'm a miner.

408
00:16:08,074 --> 00:16:08,734
Just kidding.

409
00:16:08,734 --> 00:16:08,894
Just kidding.

410
00:16:08,894 --> 00:16:18,854
