420
00:16:46,694 --> 00:16:50,354
Back in our student days, your dad and I used to love to drink this.

421
00:16:50,814 --> 00:16:51,594
A lot.

422
00:16:56,634 --> 00:16:59,094
Back in our student days, we used to drink.

423
00:16:59,094 --> 00:17:07,074
It was good.

424
00:17:07,074 --> 00:17:11,454
You all right?

425
00:17:11,714 --> 00:17:12,234
Please, sir.

426
00:17:12,294 --> 00:17:13,554
You've really got to wake up.

427
00:17:14,374 --> 00:17:16,914
Uh, how do you feel?

428
00:17:16,914 --> 00:17:30,474
I wonder if I should let Stella know.

429
00:17:34,474 --> 00:17:36,014
