433
00:17:39,974 --> 00:17:40,754
No, it's not, wait.

434
00:17:40,934 --> 00:17:41,794
Don't run away!

435
00:17:42,034 --> 00:17:42,194
Huh?

436
00:17:42,774 --> 00:17:43,134
Huh?

437
00:17:43,214 --> 00:17:43,874
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

438
00:17:43,874 --> 00:17:45,714
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

439
00:17:45,714 --> 00:17:46,654
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

440
00:17:46,874 --> 00:17:49,114
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

441
00:17:49,114 --> 00:18:08,574
