490
00:20:25,114 --> 00:20:26,114
Huh?

491
00:20:26,114 --> 00:20:27,114
What's up?

492
00:20:27,114 --> 00:20:28,114
Uh, well, I...

493
00:20:28,114 --> 00:20:31,114
