499
00:20:40,114 --> 00:20:41,114
Did I do something?

500
00:20:41,114 --> 00:20:43,114
Uh, well, no.

501
00:20:44,114 --> 00:20:46,114
Nothing at all!

502
00:20:46,114 --> 00:20:47,114
Hey, Kobito!

503
00:20:47,114 --> 00:20:48,114
Wait for me!

504
00:20:49,114 --> 00:20:50,114
Hmph.

505
00:20:50,114 --> 00:20:53,114
Sometimes it's best to say you don't remember, even if it's a lie.

506
00:20:53,114 --> 00:20:54,114
Oh, Kodika?

507
00:20:54,114 --> 00:20:55,114
Yeah.

