511
00:20:59,114 --> 00:21:01,114
Take care of my daughter.

512
00:21:01,114 --> 00:21:02,114
Huh?

513
00:21:02,114 --> 00:21:04,114
Yes, of course.

514
00:21:04,114 --> 00:21:05,114
Pegasus.

515
00:21:05,114 --> 00:21:08,114
You twerp!

516
00:21:08,114 --> 00:21:10,114
I gotta go.

517
00:21:10,114 --> 00:21:11,114
Thank you so much.

518
00:21:11,114 --> 00:21:15,114
Dumb, dumb, da-dumb, dumb, dumb.

519
00:21:15,114 --> 00:21:16,114
Stella, what are you...

520
00:21:16,114 --> 00:21:17,114
What are you...

521
00:21:24,114 --> 00:21:25,114
Huh?

522
00:21:30,114 --> 00:21:31,114
Jay?

523
00:21:41,114 --> 00:21:42,114
Hey?

524
00:21:42,114 --> 00:22:06,774
All right.

525
00:23:41,836 --> 00:23:42,836
When I woke up in the morning,

526
00:23:42,836 --> 00:23:45,836
