527
00:23:45,836 --> 00:23:46,836
Hayato.

528
00:23:46,836 --> 00:23:49,836
Oh, no, you say my dad's name in your sleep?

529
00:23:49,836 --> 00:23:51,836
Where did you come from? Why are you in my bed?

530
00:23:51,836 --> 00:23:54,836
What in the name of everything holy is going on here?

531
00:23:54,836 --> 00:23:57,836
I'm Kodaka, Hayato's son, and this is supposed to be my bed.

532
00:23:57,836 --> 00:23:58,836
You're the one who got wasted and...

533
00:23:58,836 --> 00:23:59,836
So you're saying nothing happened.

534
00:23:59,836 --> 00:24:01,836
Sorry, you're not my type.

535
00:24:01,836 --> 00:24:03,836
Next, no one sleeps at camp.

536
00:24:03,836 --> 00:24:05,836
Really, if you're telling me little white lies,

537
