I swear I will never forgive you.

538
00:24:07,836 --> 00:24:09,836
That's actually kind of cute.

539
00:24:10,836 --> 00:24:11,836
Yolanda, baby

540
00:24:11,836 --> 00:24:12,836
I like this anyway.

541
00:24:12,836 --> 00:24:13,836
I see.

542
00:24:13,836 --> 00:24:34,836
When you see me in your Facebook,

543
00:24:34,836 --> 00:24:35,836
I'm still empty.

544
00:24:35,836 --> 00:24:37,836
I'm sorry.

